{'symbol': 'BRO', 'date': '2021-12-13 17:00:00', 'title': 'BROWN & BROWN, INC. ANNOUNCES THE ACQUISITION OF DEALER ADMIN. SERVICES, INC. BY BROWN & BROWN DEALER SERVICES', 'text': 'DAYTONA BEACH, FLA., DEC. 13, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- J. SCOTT PENNY, CHIEF ACQUISITIONS OFFICER OF BROWN & BROWN, INC. (NYSE:BRO), AND BILL KELLY AND JOEL KANSANBACK, OWNERS OF DEALER ADMIN. SERVICES, INC. (“DAS”), TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT BROWN & BROWN DEALER SERVICES (“BBDS”) HAS ACQUIRED SUBSTANTIALLY ALL OF THE ASSETS OF DAS.'}{'symbol': 'BRO', 'date': '2021-12-13 06:45:00', 'title': 'BROWN & BROWN, INC. ANNOUNCES THE ASSET ACQUISITION OF CORPORATE INSURANCE ADVISORS, L.L.C.', 'text': 'DAYTONA BEACH, FLA., DEC. 13, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- J. SCOTT PENNY, CHIEF ACQUISITIONS OFFICER OF BROWN & BROWN, INC. (NYSE:BRO), AND MARK R. SCHWARTZ, THE PRINCIPAL OF CORPORATE INSURANCE ADVISORS, L.L.C., TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT BROWN & BROWN OF FLORIDA, INC., A SUBSIDIARY OF BROWN & BROWN, INC., HAS ACQUIRED SUBSTANTIALLY ALL OF THE ASSETS OF CORPORATE INSURANCE ADVISORS.'}